  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance to IDPs and socially vulnerable population groups</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">After receiving funds from SV, the NGO My City Yuzhne intends to purchase food from wholesale suppliers under a purchase / sale agreement in an amount that will form 2500 sets. After that, freight transport will be rented to deliver food to the grocery warehouses (there are 2 different suppliers in Odesa Region) of the public organization, which is located in the city of Yuzhne. It is also planned to use grant funds to upgrade computer equipment for the office of the NGO in order to be able to more effectively process data on the organization&apos;s activities  and material incentives for volunteers.</narrative>
  </description>
